chapter.name=The Goblin Breach
quest.goblin-breach-anomalies.title=Void anomalies
quest.goblin-breach-anomalies.description=Void crystals tear through the land, humming with something that does not belong here.
quest.goblin-breach-anomalies.short=Shatter 3 Void anomaly crystals
quest.goblin-breach-bangstick.title=Bangsticks
quest.goblin-breach-bangstick.description=Turn the powder against its owners.
quest.goblin-breach-bangstick.short=Craft 2 bangsticks at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-boom-powder.title=Boom powder
quest.goblin-breach-boom-powder.description=Boomshrooms grow in the damp of the mine, and goblins grind them into something far less peaceful.
quest.goblin-breach-boom-powder.short=Craft 4 boom powder at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-burners.title=Flamethrowers
quest.goblin-breach-burners.description=Goblins with flamethrowers burn their way through the webs. Put out their fire.
quest.goblin-breach-burners.short=Kill 2 goblin burners
quest.goblin-breach-coffer.title=The veilbound coffer
quest.goblin-breach-coffer.description=A locked coffer draws every goblin in earshot the moment it opens.
quest.goblin-breach-coffer.short=Open a veilbound coffer and kill 12 goblins defending it
quest.goblin-breach-coffer-key.title=A veilbound key
quest.goblin-breach-coffer-key.description=The entombed spawn carried a strange key. Keep it until you find what it opens.
quest.goblin-breach-coffer-key.short=Pick up the veilbound key of the entombed spawn
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.floor-1.title=First landing
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.floor-2.title=Second landing
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.floor-3.title=Third landing
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.title=The ruined watchtower
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.description=Skeleton archers hold the old stone watchtowers, and every landing is theirs.
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.short=Climb a stone watchtower floor by floor
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-top.title=Top of the ruined tower
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-top.description=From up there, the whole breach lies open, and every goblin in it.
quest.goblin-breach-crypt-tower-top.short=Reach the top of a stone watchtower
quest.goblin-breach-daily-hunt.title=The day's cull
quest.goblin-breach-daily-hunt.description=The breaches refill as fast as they are emptied.
quest.goblin-breach-daily-hunt.short=Kill 50 goblins in any Goblin Breach
quest.goblin-breach-entombed.title=The entombed spawn
quest.goblin-breach-entombed.description=A Voidspawn lies sealed in crystal among the large anomalies and outposts.
quest.goblin-breach-entombed.short=Free the Voidspawn sealed in crystal, then slay it
quest.goblin-breach-fragment.title=A fragment of your own
quest.goblin-breach-fragment.description=Every breach opens on the <color is="#e0b25a">Guttering Hollows</color>, a pocket of the world the goblins call home.\n\nWith a fragment of your own, it opens when you choose.
quest.goblin-breach-fragment.short=Craft a Guttering Hollows fragment at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-gadgets.title=Dubious assemblies
quest.goblin-breach-gadgets.description=Scrap and Void crystal make the heart of every goblin gadget.
quest.goblin-breach-gadgets.short=Craft 3 dubious assemblies at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-glider.title=Scrap glider
quest.goblin-breach-glider.description=The goblins' finest work: a glider of scrap, silk and Voidtaken Grizzly hide to soar off the towers.
quest.goblin-breach-glider.short=Craft a scrap glider at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-glutton.title=The Glutton
quest.goblin-breach-glutton.description=Past the mine, a goblin of enormous appetite rules the slums. Challenge it.
quest.goblin-breach-glutton.short=Defeat the Goblin Glutton in the slums
quest.goblin-breach-guardians.title=The mine guards
quest.goblin-breach-guardians.description=Shielded guardians keep watch over the deepest galleries. Bring them down.
quest.goblin-breach-guardians.short=Kill 3 goblin guardians in the mines
quest.goblin-breach-heart.title=Heart of the anomaly
quest.goblin-breach-heart.description=Deep underground, a huge anomaly feeds on a keystone crystal.
quest.goblin-breach-heart.short=Shatter the keystone crystal of a large underground anomaly
quest.goblin-breach-hookshot.title=Hookshot
quest.goblin-breach-hookshot.description=An anchor, silk and a dubious assembly: build a hookshot to reach the high places.
quest.goblin-breach-hookshot.short=Craft a hookshot at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-intruders.title=Through the breach
quest.goblin-breach-intruders.description=Goblins swarm the ruins of this lost settlement.\n\nWhoever opened the breach did not ask them first.
quest.goblin-breach-intruders.short=Kill 10 goblins in the Goblin Breach
quest.goblin-breach-knights.title=Knights of the crypt
quest.goblin-breach-knights.description=Armoured knights bar the way to the deepest tombs. Break through.
quest.goblin-breach-knights.short=Kill 3 skeleton knights in the crypt
quest.goblin-breach-lobbers.title=Bomb throwers
quest.goblin-breach-lobbers.description=Lobbers rain bombs on anyone who comes near. Get close and stop them.
quest.goblin-breach-lobbers.short=Kill 4 goblin lobbers
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.floor-1.title=First landing
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.floor-2.title=Second landing
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.floor-3.title=Third landing
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.title=The goblin watchtower
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.description=Goblin turrets bristle on the scrap watchtowers, one floor above the other.
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.short=Climb a goblin watchtower floor by floor
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-top.title=Top of the goblin tower
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-top.description=Goblins pile their treasures where no one else would bother to climb.
quest.goblin-breach-mine-tower-top.short=Reach the top of a goblin watchtower
quest.goblin-breach-miners.title=Down the mine
quest.goblin-breach-miners.description=Goblins dig ore out of the caves under the ruins. Put an end to their digging.
quest.goblin-breach-miners.short=Kill 5 goblin miners in the mines
quest.goblin-breach-nest.title=Purge the nest
quest.goblin-breach-nest.description=The spiders breed faster than the goblins can burn them. The nest has to go, all at once.
quest.goblin-breach-nest.short=Kill 25 cave spiders in a single trip into the breach
quest.goblin-breach-revenant.title=The Revenant Guardian
quest.goblin-breach-revenant.description=At the heart of the crypt, a knight of the Void still guards its masters.\n\n<i>Its masters left long ago. Nobody told it.</i>
quest.goblin-breach-revenant.short=Defeat the Revenant Guardian at the heart of the crypt
quest.goblin-breach-rocket-boots.title=Rocket boots
quest.goblin-breach-rocket-boots.description=Bangsticks, dubious assemblies and Voidtaken Grizzly hide: build boots that leap like an explosion.
quest.goblin-breach-rocket-boots.short=Craft rocket boots at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-rune.title=Rune of fire
quest.goblin-breach-rune.description=The guardian left runestone shards behind, still warm to the touch.
quest.goblin-breach-rune.short=Craft a Fireball runestone at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-scrap.title=Scrap collector
quest.goblin-breach-scrap.description=Goblins build everything from scrap. Hoard a good pile of it.
quest.goblin-breach-scrap.short=Collect 30 scraps from the goblins of the breach
quest.goblin-breach-scrap-hook.title=A sturdy anchor
quest.goblin-breach-scrap-hook.description=Every goblin contraption starts with something sturdy to hang it from.
quest.goblin-breach-scrap-hook.short=Craft a Hook Anchor at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench
quest.goblin-breach-silk.title=Spider silk
quest.goblin-breach-silk.description=Goblin gadgets need strong thread. Gather silk from the spiders.
quest.goblin-breach-silk.short=Gather 12 spider silk
quest.goblin-breach-skeletons.title=The restless dead
quest.goblin-breach-skeletons.description=Beneath the ruins, the old settlers still walk their crypt. Lay them to rest.
quest.goblin-breach-skeletons.short=Kill 8 skeletons in the crypt of the breach
quest.goblin-breach-spiders.title=Webbed tunnels
quest.goblin-breach-spiders.description=Cave spiders have taken over whole tunnels. Clear their nest.
quest.goblin-breach-spiders.short=Kill 8 cave spiders in the webbed tunnels
quest.goblin-breach-void-crystals.title=Void crystals
quest.goblin-breach-void-crystals.description=Shattered anomalies leave crystals still humming with the Void. Collect them.
quest.goblin-breach-void-crystals.short=Gather 6 Void Crystal Shards
quest.goblin-breach-void-spawn.title=Creatures of the Void
quest.goblin-breach-void-spawn.description=Larvae, crawlers and worse pour out of the anomalies. Drive them back.
quest.goblin-breach-void-spawn.short=Kill 12 Void creatures in the breach
quest.goblin-breach-void-tower-top.title=The overgrown tower
quest.goblin-breach-void-tower-top.description=The Void has swallowed some watchtowers whole.
quest.goblin-breach-void-tower-top.short=Reach the top of a watchtower overgrown by the Void
quest.goblin-breach-voidtaken.title=The Voidtaken Grizzly
quest.goblin-breach-voidtaken.description=A grizzly twisted by the Void prowls the breach. Hunt it down for its hide.
quest.goblin-breach-voidtaken.short=Hunt down the Voidtaken Grizzly in the breach
